{"schema":"hsr-dialogue.v1","entryId":"unknowable-domain","chapterId":"event-rogue-46","referenceCommit":"312b4597691e0a29cf9828a15b592757dba86949","textReferenceCommit":"74a7b96fba32f00cf495a5c00b0311bd02207aaf","sourceIds":["event-rogue-46"],"missing":0,"rows":[{"id":"unknowable-domain-event-rogue-46-talk-403815172-line","entryId":"unknowable-domain","chapterId":"event-rogue-46","missionId":"event-rogue-46","mission":"완•매 (2)","scene":"완•매 (2)","type":"dialogue","speaker":"시뮬레이션 우주","text":"당신은 비틀거리며 낯익은 공간에 도착했다. 급히 고개를 들자 실험대 앞에 서 있는 여자가 보였다. 그녀는 왼손으로는 자수틀을 잡고, 오른손으로는 마지막 실을 잡아당긴 후 그것을 이빨로 끊어냈다","talkId":403815172,"textHash":"874913253740957911","source":"rogueHandBookEvent:46/talk-403815172","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"b5335124ea296614","bwikiNextIds":["unknowable-domain-event-rogue-46-talk-403815173-line"],"bwikiPage":"阮•梅（其二）","bwikiRevision":58319,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-8713","bwikiMission":"완•매 (2)"},{"id":"unknowable-domain-event-rogue-46-talk-403815173-line","entryId":"unknowable-domain","chapterId":"event-rogue-46","missionId":"event-rogue-46","mission":"완•매 (2)","scene":"완•매 (2)","type":"dialogue","speaker":"시뮬레이션 우주","text":"「또 내 슬라이스에 함부로 들어왔네」 등을 돌린 채 말하는 완•매의 목소리엔 높낮이 변화가 없었다. 「아직 작품이 완성되지 않았는데」","talkId":403815173,"textHash":"5646225732638952877","source":"rogueHandBookEvent:46/talk-403815173","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"b5335124ea296614","bwikiNextIds":["unknowable-domain-event-rogue-46-talk-403815174-line"],"bwikiPage":"阮•梅（其二）","bwikiRevision":58319,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-8713","bwikiMission":"완•매 (2)"},{"id":"unknowable-domain-event-rogue-46-talk-403815174-line","entryId":"unknowable-domain","chapterId":"event-rogue-46","missionId":"event-rogue-46","mission":"완•매 (2)","scene":"완•매 (2)","type":"dialogue","speaker":"시뮬레이션 우주","text":"그리곤 잠시 망설이던 그녀가 당신 쪽으로 고개를 돌렸다. 몇 초간의 정적이 흐르고 그녀가 한숨을 내쉬더니 실험대에서 내려왔다. 향긋한 디저트 향기가 몰려왔다. 「이왕 왔으니… 좀 봐줄래? 어떤 도안이 제일 『완벽한 작품』 같아?」","talkId":403815174,"textHash":"17076284907548648298","source":"rogueHandBookEvent:46/talk-403815174","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"b5335124ea296614","bwikiNextIds":["unknowable-domain-event-rogue-46-talk-403815175-line"],"bwikiPage":"阮•梅（其二）","bwikiRevision":58319,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-8713","bwikiMission":"완•매 (2)"},{"id":"unknowable-domain-event-rogue-46-talk-403815175-line","entryId":"unknowable-domain","chapterId":"event-rogue-46","missionId":"event-rogue-46","mission":"완•매 (2)","scene":"완•매 (2)","type":"dialogue","speaker":"시뮬레이션 우주","text":"「맞히면… 보상을 줄게」","talkId":403815175,"textHash":"14890133939738471158","source":"rogueHandBookEvent:46/talk-403815175","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"b5335124ea296614","bwikiNextIds":[],"bwikiPage":"阮•梅（其二）","bwikiRevision":58319,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-8713","bwikiMission":"완•매 (2)"},{"id":"unknowable-domain-event-rogue-46-talk-403815180-line","entryId":"unknowable-domain","chapterId":"event-rogue-46","missionId":"event-rogue-46","mission":"완•매 (2)","scene":"완•매 (2)","type":"dialogue","speaker":"시뮬레이션 우주","text":"「보상이야」","talkId":403815180,"textHash":"12823160085671346816","source":"rogueHandBookEvent:46/talk-403815180","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"2369b6c5af7091ad","bwikiNextIds":[],"bwikiPage":"阮•梅（其二）","bwikiRevision":58319,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-8713","bwikiMission":"완•매 (2)"},{"id":"unknowable-domain-event-rogue-46-text-293952447691979896-choice","entryId":"unknowable-domain","chapterId":"event-rogue-46","missionId":"event-rogue-46","mission":"완•매 (2)","scene":"완•매 (2)","type":"choice","speaker":"","text":"사물의 본질을 추소한다","talkId":null,"textHash":"293952447691979896","source":"rogueHandBookEvent:46/text-293952447691979896","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"93a93d052dee7bc9","bwikiNextIds":[],"bwikiPage":"阮•梅（其二）","bwikiRevision":58319,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-8713","bwikiMission":"완•매 (2)"},{"id":"unkno